# packages/gen-server is now COMMITTED (GH #45). It is generated from
# openapi.yaml by `make init`, but leaving it ignored meant a fresh clone -
# and every CI job - could not resolve the path dependency and failed to
# build at all. Committing it also makes the generated API surface reviewable
# in diffs, which matters while the generator is pinned. Removed entirely
# when #53 drops codegen.
